of=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Otherworld\">Otherworld</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32271,31347,14\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32271, 31347, 14)</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tThis boss has the ability of the combination of the 3 mini-boss before him. <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Hunger\">The Hunger</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Rage\">The Rage</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Destruction\">The Destruction</a>. World Devourer never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\t1st mechanic: When <a href=\"#/wiki/Greed\">Greed</a> appears, Walk the boss over the teleport so that it changes its color then walk the <a href=\"#/wiki/Greed\">Greed</a> on the teleport so it disappears. Shooters should focus on the summons and ads to clear the way for the knights handling the boss and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Greed\">Greed</a>. The longer it takes to get rid of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Greed\">Greed</a>, the more <a href=\"#/wiki/Greed\">Greed</a> will appear. \n</p><p>2nd mechanic: Whenever a <a href=\"#/wiki/Disruption\">Disruption</a> appears, make sure to kill it as soon as possible so that it does not transform into <a href=\"#/wiki/Overcharged%20Disruption\">Overcharged Disruption</a>, which is significantly stronger.\n</p><p>3rd mechanic: Whenever a <a href=\"#/wiki/Frenzy\">Frenzy</a> appears, make sure to kill it then resume attacking the boss.\n</p><p>Priority goes to killing <a href=\"#/wiki/Disruption\">Disruption</a> over <a href=\"#/wiki/Frenzy\">Frenzy</a> to avoid them changing to their overcharged form.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\">  <img alt=\"World_Devourer_(TMA_2020)\" class=\"\" data-video-key=\"World_Devourer_(TMA_2020)\" data-video-name=\"World Devourer (TMA 2020)\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/World_Devourer_TMA_2020_77178b.png\" width=\"250\"/> <span class=\"thumbnail-play-icon-container\"> <svg aria-label=\"Play\" class=\"thumbnail-play-icon wds-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-player-icon-play\"></use></svg> </span>  <figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>On November 28, 2022, the Winter Update 2022 reduced its cooldown from 14 days to 13 days and 20 hours.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based 